        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Huaihua, Qitaihe, Hunan, Heilongjiang, China\n- People: Cheng Yi\n- Roles: prefecture-level city, actor\n- Organizations: Central Academy of Drama\n- Works: Beauty World\n\nFacts:\n- Huaihua is a prefecture-level city in southwestern Hunan, China.\n- Qitaihe is a prefecture-level city in eastern Heilongjiang province, People's Republic of China.\n- Cheng Yi was born in Huaihua, Hunan, China.\n- Cheng Yi made his television debut in the Chinese television drama \"Beauty World\" in 2011.\n- Cheng Yi graduated from the Central Academy of Drama in 2012.",
